# PART 7A — LESSON ARCHETYPES

> Linear template (Recall→Input→…→SRS) **НЕ** обязателен для каждого урока. Он — набор доступных
> блоков, из которых каждый урок собирает свой профиль. Ниже — 8 archetypes.

| # | Archetype | Purpose | Typical blocks | Required blocks | Optional blocks | Suitable levels |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Foundation / Pronunciation | поставить звуковую базу | Input, Controlled, Retrieval, Exit | Input, Controlled Practice, Exit Check | Guided Production, Comprehension | A0 |
| 2 | Grammar Introduction | ввести грамматическую форму | Input, Controlled, Retrieval | Input, Controlled Practice, Retrieval, Exit Check | Guided Production | A0–B1 |
| 3 | Grammar + Communication | ввести форму и сразу применить в речи | Input, Controlled, Guided, Communication | Input, Controlled, Guided Production, Exit Check | Retrieval, Communication | A1–B1 |
| 4 | Listening Focus | тренировать comprehension | Input (аудио), Comprehension, Retrieval | Input, Comprehension, Exit Check | Controlled, Guided | A1–B1 |
| 5 | Reading Focus | тренировать reading comprehension | Input (текст), Comprehension | Input, Comprehension, Exit Check | Guided Production | A1–B1 |
| 6 | Integrated Communication | объединить навыки в задаче | Recall, Guided, Communication, Free, Feedback | Recall, Guided Production, Communication, Feedback, Exit Check | Free Production, Controlled | A2–B1 |
| 7 | Review / Consolidation | рециклировать и закрепить | Recall, Retrieval, Exit | Recall, Retrieval, Exit Check | Communication | A0–B1 |
| 8 | Assessment / Capstone | продуктивно применить весь уровень | Recall, Free, Feedback, Exit | Recall, Free Production, Feedback, Exit Check | Comprehension | A2–B1 |

